Package: RetailPredictiveAnalytics
Title: Retail Customer Churn Prediction and Retention Analytics
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Autonomous Data Scientist", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An end-to-end predictive analytics framework for customer churn scoring
    on the Olist Brazilian E-Commerce dataset. Features include leakage-free temporal
    cohort engineering, baseline and tree-based benchmarking (XGBoost, Random Forest),
    explainable AI (TreeSHAP, PDP), regional fairness audits, and automated batch scoring.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.6.0)
Imports:
    data.table (>= 1.15.0),
    xgboost (>= 2.0.0),
    ranger (>= 0.16.0),
    pROC (>= 1.18.0),
    ggplot2 (>= 3.5.0),
    scales (>= 1.3.0),
    gridExtra (>= 2.3),
    dplyr (>= 1.1.0),
    lubridate (>= 1.9.0),
    knitr (>= 1.45),
    markdown (>= 1.12)
